---
import Page from "../../layouts/Page.astro";
import Hero from "../../components/Hero.astro";
import Section from "../../components/Section.astro";
import SectionHead from "../../components/SectionHead.astro";
import SectionSub from "../../components/SectionSub.astro";
const title = "United Nations Joint Staff Pension Fund";
---

<Page title={title}>
  <Hero title={title} />
  <main>
    <Section>
      <SectionHead title="Summary" />
      <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto px-4 typography">
        <div>
          <p>The United Nations Joint Staff Pension Fund (UNJSPF) was facing difficulties, both externally and internally, with its web presence. Pension Fund contributors and beneficiaries struggled with finding information spread out over two separate sites, which resulted in frustration and a burden on the Fund support staff. Internally, staff content owners were hindered by cumbersome web tools and inefficient work flows.</p>
          <p>I first conducted technical assessments and staff interviews, in addition to assisting the product designers, who addressed the external content, usability, and accessibility issues. The product designers created a new design system and interface designs from user interviews and prototype testing. I then implemented the improved content organization and page layouts into functional templates and components that included improved administrative tools for the UNJSPF staff to maintain content.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </Section>
    <Section>
      <SectionHead title="Roles and Timeline" />
      <SectionSub>
        <p>Accordion</p>
      </SectionSub>
    </Section>
  </main>
</Page>
